This pack vendors text and code from two MIT-licensed upstreams. Both notices are reproduced
below, as the MIT terms require. Idea-only sources are credited without claiming their
licences cover original Sjel code. The official skill-creator's Apache-2.0 reference grant is
preserved in LICENSES/anthropic-skill-creator-Apache-2.0.txt; see the Pack README for its scope.
===============================================================================
1. stephenoffer/human-voice, pinned 9bcba2f (2026-06-23)
   Covers: skills/human-writing/scripts/ (the human_voice_linter package,
   detect_ai_prose.py, ai_prose_patterns.json) and skills/human-writing/references/
   {over-correction,structural-craft,cited-vs-matched,discourse-and-structure}.md,
   plus the material condensed into references/{registers,anti-hallucination}.md.
   https://github.com/stephenoffer/human-voice
===============================================================================

